CHAPTER.VERS:
Because the avodas kodesh of this tzedakah is not only filling up the things lacking of the kedoshim, [II Cor 8:14] but is also abounding through hodayah rabbah 

          much thanksgiving
         to Hashem;

through the proof of this Messianic Jewish sherut you bring kavod to Hashem on the basis of your submission to your Ani Ma'amin Hoda'a of the Besuras HaGeulah of Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach and on the basis of ma'aseh chesed
generosity of your terumah
contribution to them and to all kol bnei Adam;
